er-box; padding:0.5em; font-weight:400; font-size:0.944em; color:inherit; border-bottom:1px solid transparent;'>Kent Road 1 to Windsor</td><td style='box-sizing:border-box; padding:0.5em; font-weight:400; font-size:0.944em; color:inherit; border-bottom:1px solid transparent;'>46.6</td></tr><tr style='box-sizing:border-box; background-image:initial; background-position:initial; background-size:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-attachment:initial; background-origin:initial; background-clip:initial;'><td style='box-sizing:border-box; padding:0.5em; font-weight:400; font-size:0.944em; color:inherit; border-bottom:none; border-radius:0px;'><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>TOTAL</span></td><td style='box-sizing:border-box; padding:0.5em; font-weight:400; font-size:0.944em; color:inherit; border-bottom:none;'> </td><td style='box-sizing:border-box; padding:0.5em; font-weight:400; font-size:0.944em; color:inherit; border-bottom:none; border-radius:0px;'><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>201.28</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'>The following pesticides that will be used are registered under the “<span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'><em>Pest Control Products Act</em></span>” (Canada):</p><ul><li><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>Clearview Herbicide</span> Reg. #29752 (containing active ingredients: Metsulfuron-Methyl and Aminopyralid, present as potassium salt)</li><li><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>Gateway Spray Adjuvant</span> Reg.#31470 (containing active ingredient: Paraffinic Oil, and Alkoxylated alcohol)</li><li><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>Navius FLEX Herbicide </span>Reg. #30922 (containing active ingredients: Metsulfuron–Methyl and Aminocyclopyrachlor)</li></ul><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'>This pesticide use falls under the exception to the cosmetic pesticide ban mentioned in subsection 7.1 (2) of the Pesticides Act for uses related to the promotion of public health and safety.</p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'>Spraying will commence on<span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'> May 25, 2022,</span> weather permitting, and conclude by <span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>June 25, 2022.</span></p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'><span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>For more information call:</span></p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'>Green Stream at <span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>1-905-510-1229</span> (Collect calls accepted)</p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Raleway, sans-serif; font-size:18px;'>K. Daniel Newman, Weed Inspector                     <br />Email: <a href='mailto:dnewman@countyofessex.ca' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(3, 119, 172); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>dnewman@countyofessex.ca<br /></a>Phone: <span style='box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:700; font-family:inherit;'>519-776-6441 x1901</span><a href='mailto:dnewman@countyofessex.ca' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(3, 11